{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/rgsiaxbtn8fvklk0u5kusb6bcvl9esz.mp3","text":"哦，这里就是博士的办公室吗？如此甚好，待我查阅一番风水学速成指南......","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/81/9cw2jke0lhup08tiixoghcv6z0e4rle.mp3","text":"哦，这里就是博士的办公室吗？如此甚好，待我查阅一番风水学速成指南......","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/prmhdzy0ha83v2gk5mva2eochvgxbj2.mp3","text":"绝非我自夸啊，除了那点拳脚功夫，做菜烧饭，针灸按摩，风水占卜，铺砖砌墙，插秧垂钓，我是样样好手！博士，尽管吩咐，都包在我身上！","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/agunnc3bvcr1pxnbgnwhzgt0h36le6x.mp3","text":"博、博士啊，我先前闲来无事，去人事部那块帮忙，不小心瞥见了几位干员的档案，那、那个食铁兽就是那个《神鬼玄奇之天蚕不死身》的主演？真的？我能要签名吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/kxud2bgag7c0w91u9ljez2md4k5ka74.mp3","text":"师出何门？嗨，这问题堪比炎国菜系一样复杂，一般我不会随便发言的，说岔了要挨揍。不过嘛......博士你只要知道，我是廉家的最后一任传人了，哦，不过我不姓廉，我姓楚。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/qx39deeov5n1cl5uvpijqqr5n6rfvsv.mp3","text":"绝非我自夸啊，除了那点拳脚功夫，做菜烧饭，针灸按摩，风水占卜，铺砖砌墙，插秧垂钓，我是样样好手！博士，尽管吩咐，都包在我身上！","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/k4abg3q58twzyg6c40a9qm9xmi0gz6h.mp3","text":"博、博士啊，我先前闲来无事，去人事部那块帮忙，不小心瞥见了几位干员的档案，那、那个食铁兽就是那个《神鬼玄奇之天蚕不死身》的主演？真的？我能要签名吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/0nxegsiotpo4o2axcb8w2g8ro0fvem3.mp3","text":"师出何门？嗨，这问题堪比炎国菜系一样复杂，一般我不会随便发言的，说岔了要挨揍。不过嘛......博士你只要知道，我是廉家的最后一任传人了，哦，不过我不姓廉，我姓楚。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/mxziq2y39glx2r5wt62jj5mtdhgzu5z.mp3","text":"夕、夕小姐......她真的一起来罗德岛了呀。哎呀，怎么说呢，虽然记忆已经模糊不清，但我隐约好像在她的画梦之中窥见过自己凄惨的未来。欸，不提了，可怕可怕，博士也当提防提防。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/rdyiv1qo6y8uiwsd2et4bzz3blm0hxk.mp3","text":"欸，博士，您别担心我，我和那些感染者处得可好了。以前离我老家不远的地方发生过一次天灾，昏天黑地的，老吓人了。那会我师父还说过，天灾是老天爷冤枉了人间，唉，真糟心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/bsh6kyuukii2zokmao8hdixtdozk9og.mp3","text":"夕、夕小姐......她真的一起来罗德岛了呀。哎呀，怎么说呢，虽然记忆已经模糊不清，但我隐约好像在她的画梦之中窥见过自己凄惨的未来。欸，不提了，可怕可怕，博士也当提防提防。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/8ujf19yrxhdxfckvwohnsx9fubi03i0.mp3","text":"欸，博士，您别担心我，我和那些感染者处得可好了。以前离我老家不远的地方发生过一次天灾，昏天黑地的，老吓人了。那会我师父还说过，天灾是老天爷冤枉了人间，唉，真糟心。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/pgirpy4sw4k0ovbivwlxediesybonos.mp3","text":"炎熔恩人？啊，我叫她恩人，是因为她救过我，久而久之，也就习惯了。我这辈子被人救过三次，每一次，我都铭记在心。钳兽那事儿？欸，不是，恩人给我指了条路，这才是最大的恩惠。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/4uaaq033a5lm8fynrstri0z50kmqsun.mp3","text":"博士，您说啊，人，活着，能不管过去吗？那显然不能，可如果过去留下的那个结，解不开，该怎么办？您也不知道？唉，那咱们俩可真是同病相怜啊，来，嗑瓜子。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/fu2arivx4na8bc9fhomu2h9k5a16gpy.mp3","text":"勾吴城有许多很老的梧桐。哦，我只是突然想起来而已。想起秋天会掉一地的落叶，父母从乡下来看我，平时严厉的师父这会儿就会说好话，师兄师姐也不会欺负我。嗯，只是想起来而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/of7x0zeum9pl5i8214vqwf4djwgm6hl.mp3","text":"炎熔恩人？啊，我叫她恩人，是因为她救过我，久而久之，也就习惯了。我这辈子被人救过三次，每一次，我都铭记在心。钳兽那事儿？欸，不是，恩人给我指了条路，这才是最大的恩惠。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/pmzw7gxo64i49yy8cnxhdwsmuv1p024.mp3","text":"博士，您说啊，人，活着，能不管过去吗？那显然不能，可如果过去留下的那个结，解不开，该怎么办？您也不知道？唉，那咱们俩可真是同病相怜啊，来，嗑瓜子。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/8pd9g7op950z9gqia0mcwazu3aeutu4.mp3","text":"勾吴城有许多很老的梧桐。哦，我只是突然想起来而已。想起秋天会掉一地的落叶，父母从乡下来看我，平时严厉的师父这会儿就会说好话，师兄师姐也不会欺负我。嗯，只是想起来而已。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/1g0ey04pffte8su3pa5anp6axz32qxa.mp3","text":"哎，我寻思着给您也整把扇子，倒不知写点什么好？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/ezd0zrmqgj2z5u6ahzceqerym13nldt.mp3","text":"哎，我寻思着给您也整把扇子，倒不知写点什么好？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/3ooddk6z4caeekonf5maqcla766hcfi.mp3","text":"代号是吧，“乌有”，子虚乌有的乌有，您就是博士？就是我新老板啦？哎，要捶背不？要揉揉腿吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/8elsjpv1xivx4adgkghu2y3q9a8hwts.mp3","text":"代号是吧，“乌有”，子虚乌有的乌有，您就是博士？就是我新老板啦？哎，要捶背不？要揉揉腿吗？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/14bpsahdl2ygl3ux01zplfykj16yhww.mp3","text":"嚯，百般武艺，大开眼界。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/60/5r6wzola845epe71wsxzj2qt98bwu28.mp3","text":"嚯，百般武艺，大开眼界。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/niaqdp8oaym2v6ft7owl4p2wfdt03xv.mp3","text":"升职加薪！？呜呜呜，感谢博士您赏识呀，小弟我日后必赴汤蹈火，在所不辞......呃，那工资能涨多少？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/fv2akzhuak6oy6jza928mtpzc0dw5sm.mp3","text":"升职加薪！？呜呜呜，感谢博士您赏识呀，小弟我日后必赴汤蹈火，在所不辞......呃，那工资能涨多少？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/j804hb875cjs3ebfx4w6rduf6y5r4cq.mp3","text":"我迟早是要回勾吴城算清那笔糊涂账的，到时候只怕引火烧身，牵连他人，明知如此，博士您还要如此赏识我楚某人？......知遇之恩，当永世不忘。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/dilhmql00lnoodrjfs26i6641xv0izp.mp3","text":"我迟早是要回勾吴城算清那笔糊涂账的，到时候只怕引火烧身，牵连他人，明知如此，博士您还要如此赏识我楚某人？......知遇之恩，当永世不忘。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/3j7enqr9lx75r3j5e77y1kr2ca6qouy.mp3","text":"好嘞，博士您就放一百个心吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/9j5yjf6p6oddjl04kaouqoz93t203dv.mp3","text":"好嘞，博士您就放一百个心吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/4rckh010s88hv0soivgwm1alkg3t13s.mp3","text":"我来指挥？且慢，待我找找那几本兵法秘籍先......","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/c1pb7ib89lw7dxwvpucqu196oxqmp07.mp3","text":"我来指挥？且慢，待我找找那几本兵法秘籍先......","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/qv9le44id3hrn56fiwegarbmhs5l47a.mp3","text":"俗话说得好，兵来将挡，水来土掩，总有办法的啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/51/ivaxim8kb9xy8k7xut88a5sibsga6xy.mp3","text":"俗话说得好，兵来将挡，水来土掩，总有办法的啦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/armtyottsz2n0kftm357jfcjfhtcks0.mp3","text":"那一个个看着凶神恶煞，好不得了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/kie5xdl89al62e421c1in6rvo86v57i.mp3","text":"那一个个看着凶神恶煞，好不得了！","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/3s9gg5ur8o3lz1iofzu4z6eblgfv6xr.mp3","text":"您找我？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/hxec3taefuz59rz08kqw081jagljlnt.mp3","text":"这儿，这儿呢！","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/e9s2esdjk7s3ki5xwtyas1k4nqgmig7.mp3","text":"您找我？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/a90ho5ttc4ad2d9mcieovtxctm4ynfo.mp3","text":"这儿，这儿呢！","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/e9trom2gm1vftcesgix07ayxg8gvjx1.mp3","text":"好嘞，交给我吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/821s1dqzzb7jvihbtz02fhrerdlhi02.mp3","text":"不愧是博士，英明的决断！","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/698vqc50wyfkgb25r2yw3wognbqkr1e.mp3","text":"好嘞，交给我吧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/d26rsh5qirnmhhie5k2iuin0n4zumox.mp3","text":"不愧是博士，英明的决断！","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/fg3l08eh7t26um9p7jv7u0425arv11z.mp3","text":"气定，神闲。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/p0jkwxhfboow45r8j2uhw2ljhqeieqp.mp3","text":"炉火纯青，当收放自如。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/9qb5oy199ke6hyogiww5dy4xjxfcsbk.mp3","text":"月有阴晴，扇有开合。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/r1c6aac8ctwyj50bildi2sof0olo542.mp3","text":"你倒是先出招啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/7fem2atw3pgbc24abih008qxik00wxz.mp3","text":"气定，神闲。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/9t0v6l8sf71n0fd0stei2b68h3uux7g.mp3","text":"炉火纯青，当收放自如。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/7ycez7i03csda3wbmmi4h7xx830yjkt.mp3","text":"月有阴晴，扇有开合。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/p0t0grnhsmia3xxvt920tn8f2oqnqa8.mp3","text":"你倒是先出招啊。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/ehbuolqpek7q2871u2pk9zm4svg5ssq.mp3","text":"众人拾柴火焰高，咱们齐心协力，倒真能烧出个满天红霞来，不错不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/9f1wwuva1ob1n2eq2q0g4xzhh68lub6.mp3","text":"众人拾柴火焰高，咱们齐心协力，倒真能烧出个满天红霞来，不错不错。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/m333be2p5duaeezkwuu1t8x0rcbvvzj.mp3","text":"俗话说得好，得道者多助，失道者寡助，如此看来，就该是咱们赢呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/bgwn8kxbl1nu1pmd6ciy6hc8w36ok2l.mp3","text":"俗话说得好，得道者多助，失道者寡助，如此看来，就该是咱们赢呀。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/dn27921kuveuiz6kcksuvn0ppz8akz3.mp3","text":"穷寇莫追，要真有什么麻烦，咱们该一起担着。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/sr5ry9p51ybqh9r84jydnl88mzufj7g.mp3","text":"穷寇莫追，要真有什么麻烦，咱们该一起担着。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/m9447pcbob34gzuwhroq05q1syy9udm.mp3","text":"没事儿的，你们先走，我可擅长跑路了，不会有事的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/ady8uqjc295fncwlfl00zb08gag3d73.mp3","text":"没事儿的，你们先走，我可擅长跑路了，不会有事的。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/ghks72osyd50j4tv5in2u6fgnp5edq4.mp3","text":"哎呀，罗德岛真乃风水宝地，看得我眼都花啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/3wyjxpv8cgm61mkpn7gn5xyjkgflkyt.mp3","text":"哎呀，罗德岛真乃风水宝地，看得我眼都花啦。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/dyzstt8llpxowq1ezsv2snuelhq05wq.mp3","text":"唔哦？博士何故如此？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/10/hrk02l0ydf1d41dydnk33fl1tdzvyup.mp3","text":"唔哦？博士何故如此？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/9bs1zywogafrhiawqn58in6q5ovj5pi.mp3","text":"博士，要不要我教你个一招半式？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/0drgs6mug2dtkvdz3pyqqgvpd6rniuu.mp3","text":"博士，要不要我教你个一招半式？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/hhpfskvd0c891zkxfmpf4lci6cvaezc.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/bixcvbejozodcgzsq27ftu2mls3stv0.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/rpj9skci6xfksk4l4e102wekzbq4tds.mp3","text":"各位，走过路过......哎，是博士啊。今天不是放假嘛，休息区人多，我就想在这儿低价发几本生活小秘笈，给各位添个彩头。您最近睡得好吗？我正好有一本《冬季助眠呼吸吐纳法》，看看？","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/7piqavguuc44g5oq3ivvakmbzfgsqo9.mp3","text":"各位，走过路过......哎，是博士啊。今天不是放假嘛，休息区人多，我就想在这儿低价发几本生活小秘笈，给各位添个彩头。您最近睡得好吗？我正好有一本《冬季助眠呼吸吐纳法》，看看？","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/9305n1ctcryuje7smoyeec08pjoy53m.mp3","text":"这不博士嘛，巧了不是！","alt":"voice_cn/char_455_nothin/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/l3emd7nx1xf2hruyugcpn777lqkwwqx.mp3","text":"这不博士嘛，巧了不是！","alt":"voice_custom/char_455_nothin_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/od4vxvyd5802h8rg13q9it2aborbhrh.mp3","text":"哦，这里就是博士的办公室吗？如此甚好，待我查阅一番风水学速成指南......","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/fi8zzrray8lsaxncm6xl10iqs02x66o.mp3","text":"绝非我自夸啊，除了那点拳脚功夫，做菜烧饭，针灸按摩，风水占卜，铺砖砌墙，插秧垂钓，我是样样好手！博士，尽管吩咐，都包在我身上！","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/c6snn8bhinf3r58c17gj7ectua28wz8.mp3","text":"博、博士啊，我先前闲来无事，去人事部那块帮忙，不小心瞥见了几位干员的档案，那、那个食铁兽就是那个《神鬼玄奇之天蚕不死身》的主演？真的？我能要签名吗？","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/cneaym36j1rnemmqxb0fu3jizfghnpc.mp3","text":"师出何门？嗨，这问题堪比炎国菜系一样复杂，一般我不会随便发言的，说岔了要挨揍。不过嘛......博士你只要知道，我是廉家的最后一任传人了，哦，不过我不姓廉，我姓楚。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/4j9n7c2hlf34xcde3rlnob7733g6oml.mp3","text":"夕、夕小姐......她真的一起来罗德岛了呀。哎呀，怎么说呢，虽然记忆已经模糊不清，但我隐约好像在她的画梦之中窥见过自己凄惨的未来。欸，不提了，可怕可怕，博士也当提防提防。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/51/qh2t7onol7e3a86bkey269rt0gv6mxe.mp3","text":"欸，博士，您别担心我，我和那些感染者处得可好了。以前离我老家不远的地方发生过一次天灾，昏天黑地的，老吓人了。那会我师父还说过，天灾是老天爷冤枉了人间，唉，真糟心。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/hbiy6fdptfv9nvys35llfu4vmjwqtyb.mp3","text":"炎熔恩人？啊，我叫她恩人，是因为她救过我，久而久之，也就习惯了。我这辈子被人救过三次，每一次，我都铭记在心。钳兽那事儿？欸，不是，恩人给我指了条路，这才是最大的恩惠。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/bwwvf6sbuvqwad2qp7wzscq9g70p5ti.mp3","text":"博士，您说啊，人，活着，能不管过去吗？那显然不能，可如果过去留下的那个结，解不开，该怎么办？您也不知道？唉，那咱们俩可真是同病相怜啊，来，嗑瓜子。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/32/7ii4s02e5y4lkol1berc2w60u6d6hj8.mp3","text":"勾吴城有许多很老的梧桐。哦，我只是突然想起来而已。想起秋天会掉一地的落叶，父母从乡下来看我，平时严厉的师父这会儿就会说好话，师兄师姐也不会欺负我。嗯，只是想起来而已。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/s8k8hr8byo7kyv844wjolx7w2a4r3t1.mp3","text":"哎，我寻思着给您也整把扇子，倒不知写点什么好？","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/1gehg4axcm9isajh8k5y0xl1v4q3jxi.mp3","text":"代号是吧，“乌有”，子虚乌有的乌有，您就是博士？就是我新老板啦？哎，要捶背不？要揉揉腿吗？","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/13/61skb8zzv8p329i6bwjeeylnvpr13za.mp3","text":"嚯，百般武艺，大开眼界。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/i8k5ii31g9fhwb2km9tgpd93sbwvm52.mp3","text":"升职加薪！？呜呜呜，感谢博士您赏识呀，小弟我日后必赴汤蹈火，在所不辞......呃，那工资能涨多少？","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/i1brdmwwu89m4nys908m3vbditqm6pi.mp3","text":"我迟早是要回勾吴城算清那笔糊涂账的，到时候只怕引火烧身，牵连他人，明知如此，博士您还要如此赏识我楚某人？......知遇之恩，当永世不忘。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/1dzhgm1bm0v1nbyvwjty54cahzqildm.mp3","text":"好嘞，博士您就放一百个心吧。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/qsrn85jgiv96cg7ixfjgawpixf6zpgc.mp3","text":"我来指挥？且慢，待我找找那几本兵法秘籍先......","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/quzn5eklb4kfwo2z4s4k7wnrlcz52dm.mp3","text":"俗话说得好，兵来将挡，水来土掩，总有办法的啦。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/rnhhui25mo8bt21s3zwva1135xtq754.mp3","text":"那一个个看着凶神恶煞，好不得了！","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/6hbwhmdlqvye3ry5g56zdwdtiuokxa5.mp3","text":"您找我？","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/mtl6z90r21xhiu14us1zdea5vhamuym.mp3","text":"这儿，这儿呢！","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/q5hhv7b575ak27zhct9dkdselccgbt6.mp3","text":"好嘞，交给我吧。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/m4sdhejfzzhm83e7ry9u1j1lt0mlgbq.mp3","text":"不愧是博士，英明的决断！","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/taok82qwmuk2g1a2j3j4d9duvkqxx55.mp3","text":"气定，神闲。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/q4ak42t0vzleamfd2vpt075ayz4ppum.mp3","text":"炉火纯青，当收放自如。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/a8qgk84qjvibf57u7wgyizpvuic53kh.mp3","text":"月有阴晴，扇有开合。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/od30q761jmrsnln0hza6su29cy3lzhb.mp3","text":"你倒是先出招啊。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/sxrw8g560e9fjuzlu560pc8q0cfbbgh.mp3","text":"众人拾柴火焰高，咱们齐心协力，倒真能烧出个满天红霞来，不错不错。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/qps84azr0upjd98cmg1lea1ebucu5vd.mp3","text":"俗话说得好，得道者多助，失道者寡助，如此看来，就该是咱们赢呀。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/eikh0jiny37a8ql4ab1fgzk6ezjj80y.mp3","text":"穷寇莫追，要真有什么麻烦，咱们该一起担着。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/k7vhfh8t1rf6fogvve43jr6sainrtll.mp3","text":"没事儿的，你们先走，我可擅长跑路了，不会有事的。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/agkyvuca2cvbz4bmjxkw3sd628ezawk.mp3","text":"哎呀，罗德岛真乃风水宝地，看得我眼都花啦。","alt":"voice/char_455_nothin/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/cy71